OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate woman's
OL,4,Aunexplained death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a 20-year-old woman is
OL,7,Fbeing investigated by police after a
OL,8,Fpost-mortem failed to establish an
OL,9,Fexact cause.
OL,11,FThe woman's body was found after
OL,12,Fofficers were called to a property on
OL,13,FHaldane Street in Gainsborough just
OL,14,Fbefore 10:00 BST on Thursday.
OL,16,FLincolnshire Police officers described
OL,17,Fthe death as "unexpected" and said
OL,18,Ftheir inquiries continued.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
